   "text": "Redis\nuploads:pending  \u00b7  list of waiting jobs\nuploads:active  \u00b7  list of taken jobs\nupload:lock:<id>  \u00b7  60 s, renewed every 20 s\nupload:failures:<id>  \u00b7  failed runs in a row",
   "originalText": "Redis\nuploads:pending  \u00b7  list of waiting jobs\nuploads:active  \u00b7  list of taken jobs\nupload:lock:<id>  \u00b7  60 s, renewed every 20 s\nupload:failures:<id>  \u00b7  failed runs in a row",
